WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.367
Picture graphs and bar graphs

2
00:00:04.167 --> 00:00:09.467
The Grade 2 children chose their favourite fruit. Let us show it on a graph.

3
00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:14.867
Four children chose bananas, six chose mangoes and two chose oranges.

4
00:00:14.867 --> 00:00:18.433
We colour one box for each child.

5
00:00:18.433 --> 00:00:21.400
Mangoes have two more than bananas.

6
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:25.100
Altogether there are twelve children.
